Serialization -- reversible conversion of all Macaulay2 objects to strings
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides the user with the capability of saving Macaulay2 objects
in a file and recovering them later, in another Macaulay2 session.

The implementation is still experimental and preliminary.  Not all types of
objects are handled.

Author
======

  * Daniel R. Grayson (see http://www.math.uiuc.edu/~dan/ ) <dan@math.uiuc.edu>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.1 of Serialization.

